  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;RABAT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rabat is a vibrant city in Morocco known for its rich academic environment and home to Mohammed V University."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MOHAMMED V UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mohammed V University is a prestigious institution of higher learning founded in 1957, located in Rabat, Morocco, known for fostering academic excellence and intellectual curiosity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WIFAK BENGARAI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wifak Bengarai is a researcher and alumna of Mohammed V University, known for her dedication to scientific inquiry and environmental sustainability."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATLAS MOUNTAINS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Atlas Mountains are a range of mountains in North Africa, bordering Morocco, providing a geographical context for Rabat."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATLANTIC COAST&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Atlantic coast is a geographical feature adjacent to Rabat, contributing to the city's setting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FACULTY OF SCIENCES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Faculty of Sciences at Mohammed V University offers a rich academic environment for students interested in biology, chemistry, and other sciences."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF GUELPH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University of Guelph is an educational institution where Franco Vaccarino serves as the President and has an alumnus named Bengarai."&lt;SEP&gt;"University of Guelph is a Canadian university where Wifak Bengarai completed her degree in Environmental Science and conducted groundbreaking research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. MARIA RODRIGUEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Maria Rodriguez is a former thesis advisor of Wifak Bengarai at the University of Guelph, known for her support and guidance in Bengarai's academic development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DR. FRANCO VACCARINO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dr. Franco Vaccarino is the President of the University of Guelph, highlighting the institution's pride in Wifak Bengarai's success."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Environmental Science is the field of study that focuses on the impact of human activity on natural ecosystems and developing solutions for sustainability."&lt;SEP&gt;"Environmental science is the field in which Bengarai is expected to become a leading voice."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GOVERNOR GENERAL'S GOLD MEDAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Governor General's Gold Medal is a prestigious award recognizing academic excellence and research contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MOROCCO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Morocco is a country where Rabat is located, and it is known for its rich academic environment and cultural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ALGERIAN SAHARA DESERT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"While not explicitly mentioned, the Algerian Sahara Desert is referenced as a geographical context for Wifak Bengarai's research on the impact of human activity on natural ecosystems."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIVING ORGANISMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Living Organisms refer to the subjects of Wifak Bengarai's research in biology, which includes understanding their relationships with their environments."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DATA ANALYSIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Data Analysis is a key component of Wifak Bengarai's research, involving the collection and interpretation of experimental results."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXPERIMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Experiments are a crucial part of Wifak Bengarai's research, conducted in the university's laboratories to test hypotheses and gather data."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0257</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLASS DISCUSSIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
